@{
}

<div>
    <div class="page-header">
        <div class="page-header-inner">
            <div class="eyebrow"><i class="fa-solid fa-gavel"></i> Our Story</div>
            <h1>Built for Collectors,<br><em style="color:var(--gold);font-style:normal">by Collectors.</em></h1>
            <p>GAVEL is a premier online auction house connecting passionate collectors and dealers across the globe.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-mission">
        <div>
            <div class="am-label"><i class="fa-solid fa-bullseye"></i> Our Mission</div>
            <div class="am-title">Making Rare Treasures Accessible to Everyone</div>
            <p class="am-body">GAVEL was founded in 2015 with a single vision: to democratise the auction house experience. Traditionally, accessing rare and extraordinary items required entry into exclusive, high-barrier auction rooms. We changed that.</p>
            <p class="am-body">Today, over 84,000 registered bidders participate in thousands of auctions monthly — from vintage wristwatches to contemporary art, classic cars to couture fashion. Every transaction is secure, transparent, and fair.</p>
            <button class="btn-outline-lt" onclick="showPage('contact')"><i class="fa-solid fa-envelope"></i> Get in Touch</button>
        </div>
        <div class="am-visual">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-gavel am-visual-icon"></i>
            <div class="am-visual-title">Trusted Since 2015</div>
            <div class="am-visual-text">Over $42 million in items successfully auctioned with a 98% buyer and seller satisfaction rate.</div>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:20px;margin-top:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center">
                <div style="text-align:center"><div style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:700;color:var(--cream)">12K+</div><div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--soft)">Active Lots</div></div>
                <div style="text-align:center"><div style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:700;color:var(--cream)">180+</div><div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--soft)">Countries</div></div>
                <div style="text-align:center"><div style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:700;color:var(--cream)">9 yrs</div><div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--soft)">Experience</div></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-steps-bg">
        <div class="about-steps">
            <div class="sec-title" style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:8px">How GAVEL Works</div>
            <div class="sec-sub" style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:48px">From registration to winning — simple and transparent.</div>
            <div class="steps-grid">
                <div class="step-card"><div class="step-num">01</div><div class="step-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-user-plus"></i></div><div class="step-title">Create an Account</div><div class="step-desc">Sign up for free in under two minutes. Verify your identity to start bidding on any live auction.</div></div>
                <div class="step-card"><div class="step-num">02</div><div class="step-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass"></i></div><div class="step-title">Browse & Discover</div><div class="step-desc">Explore thousands of curated lots across electronics, art, fashion, vehicles, collectibles and more.</div></div>
                <div class="step-card"><div class="step-num">03</div><div class="step-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-gavel"></i></div><div class="step-title">Place Your Bid</div><div class="step-desc">Bid live or set a maximum auto-bid. We'll bid incrementally on your behalf up to your limit.</div></div>
                <div class="step-card"><div class="step-num">04</div><div class="step-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-trophy"></i></div><div class="step-title">Win & Receive</div><div class="step-desc">If you're the highest bidder when the timer ends, you win. We handle secure payment and shipping.</div></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-values">
        <div class="sec-hdr" style="margin-bottom:0"><div><div class="sec-title">Our Values</div><div class="sec-sub">What we stand for — every auction, every transaction.</div></div></div>
        <div class="values-grid">
            <div class="value-card"><div class="v-icon gold"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i></div><div class="v-title">Trust & Security</div><div class="v-desc">Every seller is verified and every item authenticated before listing. Secure payments and buyer protection on every lot.</div></div>
            <div class="value-card"><div class="v-icon red"><i class="fa-solid fa-eye"></i></div><div class="v-title">Radical Transparency</div><div class="v-desc">Full bid history, clear fee structures, and honest item descriptions. No hidden charges — ever.</div></div>
            <div class="value-card"><div class="v-icon green"><i class="fa-solid fa-globe"></i></div><div class="v-title">Global Access</div><div class="v-desc">Bidders and sellers from 180+ countries participate on our platform. We handle cross-border shipping and customs logistics.</div></div>
            <div class="value-card"><div class="v-icon ink"><i class="fa-solid fa-award"></i></div><div class="v-title">Curated Quality</div><div class="v-desc">Our expert team reviews every submission. Only the finest, most authentic items make it to auction.</div></div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="team-bg">
        <div class="team-wrap">
            <div class="team-hdr"><div class="team-title">The Team Behind GAVEL</div><div class="team-sub">Passionate experts in art, horology, fashion, and technology.</div></div>
            <div class="team-grid">
                <div class="team-card"><div class="team-avatar"><i class="fa-solid fa-user-tie"></i></div><div class="team-name">James Harrow</div><div class="team-role">Founder & CEO</div><div class="team-socials"><button class="team-soc"><i class="fa-brands fa-linkedin-in"></i></button><button class="team-soc"><i class="fa-brands fa-x-twitter"></i></button></div></div>
                <div class="team-card"><div class="team-avatar"><i class="fa-solid fa-user"></i></div><div class="team-name">Sofia Reyes</div><div class="team-role">Head of Curation</div><div class="team-socials"><button class="team-soc"><i class="fa-brands fa-linkedin-in"></i></button><button class="team-soc"><i class="fa-brands fa-instagram"></i></button></div></div>
                <div class="team-card"><div class="team-avatar"><i class="fa-solid fa-user"></i></div><div class="team-name">Marcus Lind</div><div class="team-role">CTO</div><div class="team-socials"><button class="team-soc"><i class="fa-brands fa-linkedin-in"></i></button><button class="team-soc"><i class="fa-brands fa-github"></i></button></div></div>
                <div class="team-card"><div class="team-avatar"><i class="fa-solid fa-user"></i></div><div class="team-name">Aisha Okonjo</div><div class="team-role">Head of Operations</div><div class="team-socials"><button class="team-soc"><i class="fa-brands fa-linkedin-in"></i></button><button class="team-soc"><i class="fa-brands fa-x-twitter"></i></button></div></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>